OL,5,G1100 Murder She Wrote
OL,6,     FWhile attending a book fair in
OL,7,     FMiami, Jessica Fletcher forms a
OL,8,     Fnew and unlikely alliance with a
OL,9,     FRussian detective to solve a
OL,10,     Fmystery surrounding art theft.
OL,11,G1200 Murder She Wrote
OL,12,     FJessica Fletcher helps Seth solve
OL,13,     Fa problem within the family after
OL,14,     Fhis cousin, an expert on plants,
OL,15,     Fgets in a heated argument over a
OL,16,     Fnewly-developed tree.
OL,17,G1300 Murder She Wrote
OL,18,     FJessica comes to give aid to a
OL,19,     Fgood friend who is somehow
OL,20,     Finvolved in the theft of a
OL,21,     Fpriceless Egyptian artifact.
